{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09166","headline":"送丘员外还山 · 韦应物","name":"送丘员外还山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长栖白云表，蹔访高斋宿。\n还辞郡邑諠，归泛松江渌。\n结茅隐苍岭，伐薪响深谷。\n同是山中人，不知往来躅。\n灵芝非庭草，辽鹤委池鹜。\n终当署里门，一表高阳族。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09166.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09166","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}